      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MACHFREDDY (1) finished second last start, beaten 1.4 metres, in a nice return to form at Port Pirie over 1609m. A nice draw on the front line should ensure a cosy run. Stepping up a level this time but he is capable of another big performance. NOHASHTAGREQUIRED (5) lines up for the first time. By Tiger Tara and hails from the P C Bain stable. Has the right credentials to play a major role. IMNOLOVEANBUSINESS (2) is a two-year-old filly from the Billy Weidenbach yard on debut. Likely to get all the favours from this nice draw. Sure to prove very hard to beat. RIVERGUM REGALIA (11) is better than her last-start eighth over 1800m at Globe Derby Park. She placed third two runs back and is in the mix.",
